{
 "comment": ["Manual input of tools/bake_plant_regions.py: identity of every ground-plant species token used by the installed regional plant packs.", "token = the part of a block code that names the species (genus + epithet, lower case). Evidence: the token itself, the pack's English block name (name) and, where different from taxon, the pack's own scientific name (packName, from its blockdesc lang entries).", "taxon = the name looked up in WCVP (accepted names preferred; synonyms resolved to their accepted taxon; spelling corrections explained in note).", "range: absent = WCVP native range (native, non-doubtful records). packRegion = the pack's floristic region (packs[].regions), optionally intersected with regionSets[restrictTo]. climateOnly = no geographic veto (vanilla/pack climate rules only).", "Patches from climateOnlyFiles (wild crops) keep climate-only rules: cultivated/crop plants are left alone so their seeds stay obtainable."],
 "climateOnlyFiles": ["crop.json"],
